        "title": "The best comb for persians!",
        "text": "Miss Pumpkin Pie does NOT like to be brushed. She's never liked it in the 6 years I've had her, but she tolerates this one! I can get any little mats out of her long, thick coat without issues, and without pulling too much on her skin. Quality is of course great. Wahl is the brand I trust with my beard care and my pet care!",
