        "title": "Works Great for getting ticks off the dog after a run",
        "text": "The ticks are terrible in our area. 2 hour run has resulted in 50 + ticks off the dog. This comb has made that process much easier. We still missed a few that we found after a bath but way less than before.Get this, Find Ticks, Kill them all",
